2, October to November is the driest pair in Edgefield County, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids it came in under 90% of normal in 42 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 45% of normal in November to December and 141% in July to August. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 30% of normal on the middle of the grids. Every grid had its driest year in 1954, with grid 16394 at 59% that year.</p>"}
